{"actor":"server","event":"response","topic_id":"2024-217279","model_call":34,"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"marine corps benefits\" (+ pay salary compensation) (+ housing education health))"},"record":{"query":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"marine corps benefits\" (+ pay salary compensation) (+ housing education health))"},"response":{"burrow":"/data/ssd3/claclark/msm-2.1.burrow","docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_07_1203105112#0_2166442559","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1656","rank":1,"snippet":"{ \"docid\": \"msmarco_v2.1_doc_07_1203105112#0_2166442559\" , \"end_char\": 1569.000000 , \"headings\": \" MARINE CORPS BENEFITS THE GREATEST BENEFITS ARE THE ONES THAT ARE FELT Purpose and Belonging Education Benefits<cover>Health Benefits Salary and Compensation \" , \"segment\": \"Marine Corps Benefits</cover>MARINE CORPS BENEFITS THE GREATEST BENEFITS ARE THE ONES THAT ARE FELT There are substantial benefits that come with fighting in our ranks, putting your willingness and determination up against our Nation’s obstacles and adversaries. And though things like salary, medical, education, and housing are included on that list to ensure our fighting force is the most capable in the world, they hardly compare to the most meaningful benefits Marines experience. Marines wake each day knowing they have a collective purpose to fight for, like-minded warriors to fight with, and a noble place in our Nation’s fight to proudly claim. Any Marine will tell you that this is the greatest benefit you can ever earn. Purpose and Belonging A sense of belonging in a collective purpose for a common moral cause is not something "},"time":142},"model_calls":34,"document_judgments":28,"relevance_3":12,"max_document_judgments":50,"max_model_calls":100}
